.TH UNAME 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
uname \- obtain kernel and machine identification
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/utsname.h>
.B int uname(struct utsname* name);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Writes Linux system, node, release, version, machine and domain strings to
the supplied writable Linux x86\-64 utsname structure.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set. Success leaves errno unchanged.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR uname (2)
